-- #ASSERT REFUSED, in each way it can come out other than satisfied.
--
-- 1. the expression answers, so nothing was refused
-- 2. it refuses, for a different reason than the BECAUSE names
-- 3. it raises an error, which is not a refusal

GIVETH A NUMBER
`not modelled` MEANS REFUSE "this case is not modelled"

GIVETH A NUMBER
`modelled` MEANS 1

#ASSERT REFUSED `modelled`
#ASSERT REFUSED `not modelled` BECAUSE "some other reason"
#ASSERT REFUSED (1 DIVIDED BY 0)
